    "faq_a1": "Equsto is a platform and sales engineering brand. We catalogue Öztiryakiler, Çağlayan, Proso and international manufacturers; project lists, quotes and logistics run through one channel.",
    "faq_q2": "How do I get a quote?",
    "faq_a2": "Add from product pages or use Project Factory (PFOS) with concept, capacity and m² to build an equipment list. Contact Sales Engineering for final price and delivery.",
    "faq_q3": "Are prices on the site final?",
    "faq_a3": "Showcase amounts are catalogue reference. Final quote including install, freight and MEP is confirmed in writing by Equsto per project spec.",
    "faq_q4": "What is Project Factory (PFOS)?",
    "faq_a4": "Generates equipment list, VAT and estimated logistics for restaurant, hotel, café or catering concepts in minutes. Export PDF and send to sales.",
    "faq_q5": "How are delivery and install planned?",
    "faq_a5": "Freight plan depends on weight, floors and city. Install-heavy items are clarified at quote with manufacturer or partner crews.",
    "faq_q6": "Which payment methods are accepted?",
    "faq_a6": "Corporate clients: wire/EFT, corporate card and project terms where applicable. Details shared at quote approval.",
    "faq_q7": "Which regions do you serve?",
    "faq_a7": "Based in Turkey; export-focused supply across Middle East, Caucasus, Central Asia and Balkans.",
    "faq_q8": "Warranty and after-sales",
    "faq_a8": "Products carry manufacturer warranty. Service requests go through authorised networks; Equsto coordinates the process.",
    "faq_q9": "Where do bar and clear ice projects start?",
    "faq_a9": "Bar Design (Besos) for modular bar solutions; IMT300 page for clear ice machines. Use contact or PFOS for quotes.",
    "faq_q10": "How is my personal data used?",
    "faq_a10": "Quote and contact data is processed only by Equsto; not sold to third parties. See privacy page for details."
